# 🚢 Task 02 – Exploratory Data Analysis (Titanic Dataset)

## 🎯 Objective
Perform data cleaning and exploratory data analysis (EDA) to identify patterns and relationships in the dataset.

## 📁 Dataset
Titanic dataset (provided in internship repository).

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib

## 🔍 Key Steps
- Handled missing values
- Dropped irrelevant columns
- Created visualizations for survival analysis

## 📊 Key Insights
- Female passengers had higher survival rates.
- Passenger class significantly influenced survival.
- Most passengers were between 20–40 years old.

